{"results":[{"url":"https://x.com/PIBFactCheck/status/1309371515922649088","final_url":"https://x.com/PIBFactCheck/status/1309371515922649088","title":"PIB Fact Check (@PIBFactCheck) on X","description":"Claim: Kins of those who died of COVID-19 can claim insurance under Pradhan Mantri Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (PMJJBY) and Pradhan Mantri Suraksha Bima Yojana (PMSBY)\n\n#PIBFactCheck: PMSBY doesn't cover COVID related deaths, while PMJJBY covers COVID deaths with certain conditions.","language":"en","text":"## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n# PIB Fact Check on X: \"Claim: Kins of those who died of COVID-19 can claim insurance under Pradhan Mantri Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (PMJJBY) and Pradhan Mantri Suraksha Bima Yojana (PMSBY) #PIBFactCheck: PMSBY doesn't cover COVID related deaths, while PMJJBY covers COVID deaths with certain conditions.\"\n\n## Conversation\n\nPIB Fact Check\n\n@PIBFactCheck\n\nClaim: Kins of those who died of COVID-19 can claim insurance under Pradhan Mantri Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (PMJJBY) and Pradhan Mantri Suraksha Bima Yojana (PMSBY)\n#PIBFactCheck: PMSBY doesn't cover COVID related deaths, while PMJJBY covers COVID deaths with certain conditions.\n\nread image description\n\nDD News and 3 others\n\n5:57 AM · Sep 25, 2020\n\n6","author":"https://x.com/PIBFactCheck","published_date":"2020-09-25T05:57:50.000Z","latency_ms":1436.5593260154128,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}